{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium, minimal, elegant footer section for the babywear brand KISS & KRY, replicating the uploaded reference screenshot as closely as possible.
    
    STRICT INSTRUCTION: The uploaded screenshot is the exact design reference. Do not redesign, reinterpret, or introduce a different layout. Match the positioning, spacing, proportions, background, contact cards, typography and alignment.
    
    1. OVERALL SECTION DESIGN
    
    Full-width footer section.
    
    Background: warm ivory cream (#F5F3E7).
    
    Maximum content width: 1200px.
    
    Desktop horizontal padding: 45px.
    
    Desktop vertical padding: 45px.
    
    Minimal, premium, editorial aesthetic.
    
    All main brand content centred.
    
    Use Montserrat typography throughout.
    
    No gradients, heavy shadows or decorative illustrations.
    
    2. CENTRED BRAND LOGO
    
    At the top centre, display the original Kiss & Kry logo.
    
    Use an editable Shopify image picker.
    
    Preserve the original logo artwork and proportions.
    
    Logo width: approximately 125px.
    
    Height: auto.
    
    Centre aligned.
    
    Maintain transparent background if available.
    
    Do not recreate or modify the logo using text.
    
    Below the logo, add the tagline:
    
    "Born from bamboo. Made for baby."
    
    Styling:
    
    Montserrat Regular.
    
    Font size: 11px.
    
    Colour: muted warm grey (#858575).
    
    Centre aligned.
    
    Margin-top: 12px.
    
    Margin-bottom: 35px.
    
    3. FOUR CONTACT CARDS
    
    Create exactly FOUR equally sized horizontal contact cards in one row.
    
    Desktop layout:
    
    Four equal-width columns.
    
    Gap: 12px.
    
    Each card approximately 215px wide and 65px tall.
    
    Background: white (#FFFFFF).
    
    Border radius: 15px.
    
    No prominent border.
    
    Very subtle soft shadow.
    
    Internal horizontal padding: 15px.
    
    Vertically centre all content.
    
    Each card must contain:
    
    Circular olive icon background on the left.
    
    Small uppercase category label.
    
    Contact name or number below.
    
    Small diagonal arrow icon at the far right.
    
    CARD 1 – INSTAGRAM
    
    Icon:
    
    Instagram outline SVG.
    
    Circular background: muted olive (#626B4C).
    
    Icon colour: white.
    
    Circle size: 38px.
    
    Label:
    "INSTAGRAM"
    
    Main text:
    "@kissandkry"
    
    Link:
    https://www.instagram.com/kissandkry/
    
    CARD 2 – FACEBOOK
    
    Icon:
    
    Facebook SVG.
    
    Same circular olive icon container.
    
    Label:
    "FACEBOOK"
    
    Main text:
    "Kiss & Kry"
    
    Link:
    https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61563831763161
    
    CARD 3 – WHATSAPP
    
    Icon:
    
    WhatsApp outline SVG.
    
    Same circular olive icon container.
    
    Label:
    "WHATSAPP"
    
    Main text:
    "+91 99997 38480"
    
    Link:
    https://wa.me/919999738480
    
    CARD 4 – CALL US
    
    Icon:
    
    Telephone outline SVG.
    
    Same circular olive icon container.
    
    Label:
    "CALL US"
    
    Main text:
    "+91 99997 38480"
    
    Link:
    tel:+919999738480
    
    CONTACT CARD TYPOGRAPHY
    
    Category label:
    
    Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    8px.
    
    Uppercase.
    
    Letter spacing: 1.5px.
    
    Colour: #858575.
    
    Main contact text:
    
    Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    11px.
    
    Colour: #555849.
    
    Arrow:
    
    Small northeast arrow.
    
    Colour: #A8AD91.
    
    Size: 12px.
    
    All four cards must have identical dimensions and alignment.
    
    Make each entire card clickable.
    
    4. CENTRED NAVIGATION MENU
    
    Below the four contact cards, create a single horizontally aligned navigation menu.
    
    Display exactly these six links:
    
    Shop
    
    Why bamboo
    
    Our story
    
    Reviews
    
    Care guide
    
    FAQ
    
    Styling:
    
    Horizontal layout.
    
    Centre aligned.
    
    Gap: 30px.
    
    Montserrat SemiBold.
    
    Font size: 11px.
    
    Colour: dark olive (#626B4C).
    
    No background.
    
    No borders.
    
    No underline by default.
    
    Subtle colour transition on hover.
    
    Each navigation item must have an editable destination URL.
    
    5. BOTTOM FOOTER BAR
    
    Add a thin horizontal divider below the navigation.
    
    Divider:
    
    Width: 100%.
    
    Height: 1px.
    
    Colour: #E5E0D2.
    
    Margin-top: 35px.
    
    Margin-bottom: 20px.
    
    Create a bottom horizontal row with two aligned sections.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background: #F5F3E7;
    color: #555849;
    padding: 45px 24px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    font-family: var(--font-body-family, Arial, sans-serif);
  }
  .ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__brand {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__logo {
    display: block;
    width: 125px;
    max-width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    object-fit: contain;
  }
  .ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__logo-placeholder {
    width: 125px;
    height: 70px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__logo-placeholder svg { width: 100%; height: 100%; }
  .ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tagline {
    margin: 12px 0 35px;
    color: #858575;
    font-size: 11px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__contacts {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__contact {
    min-height: 65px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 10px 12px;
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 15px;
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(66, 65, 48, 0.06);
    transition: box-shadow 160ms ease;
  }
  .ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__contact:hover { box-shadow: 0 3px 10px rgba(66, 65, 48, 0.12); }
  .ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__contact:focus-visible,
  .ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__nav a:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid #626B4C; outline-offset: 3px; }
  .ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon {
    width: 38px;
    height: 38px;
    min-width: 38px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: #fff;
    background: #626B4C;
  }
  .ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon svg { width: 19px; height: 19px; fill: none; stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.7; stroke-linecap: round; stroke-linejoin: round; }
  .ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__contact-copy { min-width: 0; flex: 1; }
  .ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__label {
    display: block;
    color: #68695C;
    font-size: 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    margin-bottom: 3px;
  }
  .ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__value {
    display: block;
    color: #555849;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.35;
    white-space: nowrap;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
  }
  .ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow { color: #777D62; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1; flex: 0 0 auto; }
  .ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__nav {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 14px 30px;
    margin-top: 30px;
  }
  .ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__nav a {
    color: #626B4C;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.5;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 160ms ease;
  }
  .ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__nav a:hover { color: #414832; }
  .ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__divider { height: 1px; background: #E5E0D2; margin: 35px 0 20px; }
  .ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__bottom {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 16px;
    color: #68695C;
    font-size: 10px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__bottom p { margin: 0; }
  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }} { padding-left: 45px; padding-right: 45px; }
  }
  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }} { padding-top: 36px; padding-bottom: 28px; }
    .ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__contacts { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    .ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__nav { gap: 14px 22px; margin-top: 26px; }
  }
  @media screen and (max-width: 380px) {
    .ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__contacts { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__inner">
    <div class="ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__brand">
      {% if block.settings.logo != blank %}
        <img class="ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__logo" src="{{ block.settings.logo | image_url: width: 400 }}" alt="{{ block.settings.logo.alt | default: 'KISS & KRY' | escape }}" loading="lazy" width="{{ block.settings.logo.width }}" height="{{ block.settings.logo.height }}">
      {% else %}
        <div class="ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__logo-placeholder">{{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}</div>
      {% endif %}
      <p class="ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__tagline">{{ block.settings.tagline | escape }}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__contacts">
      <a class="ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__contact" href="{{ block.settings.instagram_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Instagram: {{ block.settings.instagram_text | escape }}">
        <span class="ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3.5" y="3.5" width="17" height="17" rx="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4"/><circle cx="17.7" cy="6.6" r=".8" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></span>
        <span class="ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__contact-copy"><span class="ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__label">Instagram</span><span class="ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__value">{{ block.settings.instagram_text | escape }}</span></span><span class="ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
      <a class="ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__contact" href="{{ block.settings.facebook_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Facebook: {{ block.settings.facebook_text | escape }}">
        <span class="ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14.2 20v-7.3h2.5l.4-3h-2.9V7.8c0-.9.3-1.5 1.5-1.5h1.5V3.6c-.3 0-1.2-.1-2.3-.1-2.3 0-3.9 1.4-3.9 4v2.2H8.4v3h2.6V20z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></span>
        <span class="ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__contact-copy"><span class="ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__label">Facebook</span><span class="ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__value">{{ block.settings.facebook_text | escape }}</span></span><span class="ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
      <a class="ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__contact" href="{{ block.settings.whatsapp_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="WhatsApp: {{ block.settings.whatsapp_text | escape }}">
        <span class="ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M20 11.7a8 8 0 0 1-11.8 7L4 20l1.3-4A8 8 0 1 1 20 11.7Z"/><path d="M9 8.5c.3-.5.5-.5.8-.5h.4c.2 0 .3.1.4.4l.7 1.7c.1.2 0 .4-.1.5l-.5.6c-.2.2-.2.4-.1.6.4.8 1.2 1.6 2.1 2 .2.1.4.1.6-.1l.7-.8c.2-.2.4-.2.6-.1l1.6.8c.2.1.3.2.3.4 0 .3-.2 1.2-.7 1.6-.5.4-1.2.6-2 .4-1-.2-2.3-.8-3.5-1.8-1.3-1.1-2.1-2.5-2.4-3.3-.3-.8-.1-1.8.2-2.4Z"/></svg></span>
        <span class="ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__contact-copy"><span class="ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__label">WhatsApp</span><span class="ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__value">{{ block.settings.whatsapp_text | escape }}</span></span><span class="ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
      <a class="ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__contact" href="{{ block.settings.phone_url }}" aria-label="Call us: {{ block.settings.phone_text | escape }}">
        <span class="ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M7 3.8h3l1.5 4-2 1.6a15 15 0 0 0 5.1 5.1l1.6-2 4 1.5v3c0 1-1 2-2 2C10 19 5 14 4 5.8c0-1 1-2 3-2Z"/></svg></span>
        <span class="ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__contact-copy"><span class="ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__label">Call us</span><span class="ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__value">{{ block.settings.phone_text | escape }}</span></span><span class="ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
      </a>
    </div>
    <nav class="ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__nav" aria-label="Footer navigation">
      <a href="{{ block.settings.shop_url }}">Shop</a><a href="{{ block.settings.bamboo_url }}">Why bamboo</a><a href="{{ block.settings.story_url }}">Our story</a><a href="{{ block.settings.reviews_url }}">Reviews</a><a href="{{ block.settings.care_url }}">Care guide</a><a href="{{ block.settings.faq_url }}">FAQ</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__divider" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="ai-kry-footer-{{ ai_gen_id }}__bottom"><p>{{ block.settings.copyright | escape }}</p><p>{{ block.settings.bottom_note | escape }}</p></div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Kiss & Kry footer",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "range", "id": "desktop_width_percent", "label": "Desktop width", "min": 50, "max": 100, "step": 5, "unit": "%", "default": 100 },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "logo", "label": "Brand logo" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "tagline", "label": "Tagline", "default": "Born from bamboo. Made for baby." },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Contact cards" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "instagram_text", "label": "Instagram text", "default": "@kissandkry" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "instagram_url", "label": "Instagram link" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "facebook_text", "label": "Facebook text", "default": "Kiss & Kry" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "facebook_url", "label": "Facebook link" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "whatsapp_text", "label": "WhatsApp text", "default": "+91 99997 38480" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "whatsapp_url", "label": "WhatsApp link" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "phone_text", "label": "Phone text", "default": "+91 99997 38480" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "phone_url", "label": "Telephone link", "default": "tel:+919999738480" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Navigation links" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "shop_url", "label": "Shop link" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "bamboo_url", "label": "Why bamboo link" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "story_url", "label": "Our story link" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "reviews_url", "label": "Reviews link" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "care_url", "label": "Care guide link" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "faq_url", "label": "FAQ link" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Bottom bar" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "copyright", "label": "Left text", "default": "© KISS & KRY. All rights reserved." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "bottom_note", "label": "Right text", "default": "Made with care for little ones." }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Kiss & Kry footer" }],
  "tag": null,
  "class": "kiss-kry-footer-block"
}
{% endschema %}